    "detailed_description": "<table><tr><th><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e WELCOME TO ANOTHER ONE OF 100 CATS SERIES GAME\u00a0\ud83d\udc08</h2>Join the cutest adventure in the world full of cats! Explore the charming hand-drawn artwork of special themed locations as you embark on a quest to find 100 adorable cats hidden throughout the game.<br>Test your attention and observation skills in this cozy and delightful hidden object game. <br>Each cat is more charming than the last, and every discovery brings a smile to your face.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc08\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Can you find them all?\u00a0\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc08</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954560/extras/e7cd0de09d088ce0a77b11e17d79ea01.avif?t=1750937816\" width=600 height=125 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></th></tr></table><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfae 2 Levels<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc08 200 Hidden Cats<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb5 Awesome Soundtrack<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfa8 High Quality Resolution Artworks<br></li><li>\ud83c\udf17 Brightness Settings<br></li><li>\ud83d\udcbe Progress Saves<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd0d Zoom<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude3a Real Meow Sounds!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udca5 Combo Counter!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udca1 Tips<br></li><li>\ud83c\udf10 No Text</li></ul>",
